WEBVTT

00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:04.388
Why don't you help Potter
put his books back.

00:00:13.021 --> 00:00:15.274
You know,
if you're interested in plants...

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.985
...you'd be better off with
Goshawk's Guide to Herbology.

00:00:18.569 --> 00:00:22.865
Do you know there's a wizard in Nepal
who's growing gravity-resistant trees?

00:00:23.031 --> 00:00:26.785
Neville, no offense,
but I really don't care...

00:00:27.536 --> 00:00:29.163
...about plants.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.248
Now, if there's...

00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:36.170
...a Tibetan turnip that will allow me
to breathe underwater for an hour...

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.797
...then great. But otherwise--

00:00:39.006 --> 00:00:42.676
I don't know about a turnip.
But you could always use gillyweed.

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:46.597
-Any bets? Any bets?
-Come on, place your bets!

00:00:46.847 --> 00:00:48.307
Step up, mates! Don't be shy.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:49.933
-Three lads.
-One lady.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.311
-Four go down.
-But do four come up?

00:00:52.603 --> 00:00:54.146
Don't be so mean.

00:00:54.688 --> 00:00:56.607
-Any bets?
-Fleur's 10-1.

00:00:58.609 --> 00:01:00.694
HARRY: You're sure about this, Neville?
-Absolutely.

00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:02.821
HARRY: For an hour?
-Most likely.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.531
Most likely?

00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:06.825
Well, there is some debate
among herbologists...

00:01:07.075 --> 00:01:09.536
...as to the effects of fresh water
versus salt water--

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:12.456
You're telling me this now?
You must be joking!

00:01:12.623 --> 00:01:14.541
I just wanted to help.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.711
Well, that makes you a right sight
better than Ron and Hermione.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.630
Where are they anyway?

00:01:19.838 --> 00:01:22.841
-You seem a little tense, Harry.
-Do I?

00:01:29.848 --> 00:01:32.184
DUMBLEDORE:
Welcome to the second task.

00:01:32.351 --> 00:01:35.979
Last night, something was stolen
from each of our champions.

00:01:36.188 --> 00:01:37.564
A treasure of sorts.

00:01:37.648 --> 00:01:40.359
These four treasures,
one for each champion...

00:01:40.609 --> 00:01:43.237
...now lie on the bottom
of the Black Lake.

00:01:43.487 --> 00:01:44.947
In order to win...

00:01:45.113 --> 00:01:48.951
...each champion need only find
their treasure and return to the surface.

00:01:49.117 --> 00:01:51.703
-Simple enough, except for this:
-Put that in your mouth.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.582
They will have but one hour to do so,
and one hour only.

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:59.670
After that, they'll be on their own.
No magic will save them.

00:02:00.128 --> 00:02:02.506
You may begin
at the sound of the cannon.

00:02:28.907 --> 00:02:31.785
-What's the matter with him?
-I don't know, I can't see him.

00:02:33.245 --> 00:02:36.164
Oh, my God.
I've killed Harry Potter.

00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:39.918
SEAMUS:
Yeah!

00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:42.713
What?

00:03:41.229 --> 00:03:42.439
Oh!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.503
DUMBLEDORE: The Beauxbatons
champion, Miss Delacour...

00:04:04.753 --> 00:04:07.130
...has unfortunately
been forced to retire...

00:04:07.798 --> 00:04:10.842
...so she will take no further part
in this task.

00:05:28.837 --> 00:05:30.547
But she's my friend too!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.884
Only one!

00:06:25.143 --> 00:06:27.020
Let's get down below.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.950
[CHANTING]
Krum! Krum! Krum!

00:07:37.465 --> 00:07:39.092
-Yes!
-Whoo!

00:07:57.235 --> 00:07:59.362
Ascendio!

00:08:04.618 --> 00:08:06.244
Harry!

00:08:08.622 --> 00:08:10.040
He's all right.

00:08:11.249 --> 00:08:12.751
He's all right. Barty!

00:08:13.001 --> 00:08:13.003
SEAMUS: Go get him another towel.
-I want all the judges over here now!

